      <body>
         <div xml:id="vicavContributeBibliography">
            <head>Contributing</head>
            <p>If you want to help us enhance the bibliography there are different
               possibilities to proceed. We have set up a publicly available ZOTERO group
               <ref target="https://www.zotero.org/groups/2165756/vicav">VICAV_public</ref> where you can enter your proposals. We will furnish them with
               the metadata and enter them in the VICAV bibliography.</p>

            <p>If you have data in Word documents, spread-sheets or whatever and
               would like us to integrate it in VICAV, get in touch and we will find
               a way to do it.</p>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
